{"id":"8d589b23ec7c910b","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-monic-epic.md","title":"Monomorphisms and Epimorphisms","display":"df-monic-epic — Monomorphisms and Epimorphisms","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-monic-epic","aliases":["58-df-monic-epic"],"display":"df-monic-epic — Monomorphisms and Epimorphisms","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-category.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-monic-epic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-monic-epic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-monic-epic — Monomorphisms and Epimorphisms"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category.md\">../batch04/58-df-category.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,\\mathcal C,C_0,C_1,s,t,\\circ,e\\in V\">\\(f,\\mathcal C,C_0,C_1,s,t,\\circ,e\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s,t,\\circ,e\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s,t,\\circ,e\\rangle\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Category}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Category}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category.md\">../batch04/58-df-category.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Monic}_S,\\mathrm{Epic}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Monic}_S,\\mathrm{Epic}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}monic\\text{-}epic} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Monic}_S(f,\\mathcal{C}) \\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land f\\in C_1\\land\n\\forall X\\in C_0\\;\\forall g,h\\in C_1\\;\\bigl((s(g)=X\\land t(g)=s(f)\\land s(h)=X\\land t(h)=s(f)\\land f\\circ g=f\\circ h)\\to g=h\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}monic\\text{-}epic} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Monic}_S(f,\\mathcal{C}) \\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land f\\in C_1\\land\n\\forall X\\in C_0\\;\\forall g,h\\in C_1\\;\\bigl((s(g)=X\\land t(g)=s(f)\\land s(h)=X\\land t(h)=s(f)\\land f\\circ g=f\\circ h)\\to g=h\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}monic\\text{-}epic\\text{-}epic} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Epic}_S(f,\\mathcal{C}) \\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land f\\in C_1\\land\n\\forall X\\in C_0\\;\\forall g,h\\in C_1\\;\\bigl((s(g)=t(f)\\land t(g)=X\\land s(h)=t(f)\\land t(h)=X\\land g\\circ f=h\\circ f)\\to g=h\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}monic\\text{-}epic\\text{-}epic} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Epic}_S(f,\\mathcal{C}) \\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land f\\in C_1\\land\n\\forall X\\in C_0\\;\\forall g,h\\in C_1\\;\\bigl((s(g)=t(f)\\land t(g)=X\\land s(h)=t(f)\\land t(h)=X\\land g\\circ f=h\\circ f)\\to g=h\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Monomorphisms generalize injective maps; epimorphisms generalize surjective maps.</li>\n<li>In Set, both notions coincide with set-theoretic injections/surjections.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]",